second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the population of Madi Municipality?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 83, \"text\": \"Madi, Chitwan Madi (माडी नगरपालिका) is a municipality in Chitwan District of Nepal.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 84, \"end\": 163, \"text\": \"With the population about 50,000, it is the fifth municipality in the district.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 164, \"end\": 310, \"text\": \"Basantapur was the major town of the former Baghauda Village Development Committee (बघौंडा गा.वि.स.) that was incorporated into Madi Municipality.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 311, \"end\": 351, \"text\": \"It is adjacent to Chitwan National Park.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 352, \"end\": 414, \"text\": \"This municipality was formed by cabinet dated 2071-01-28 (BS).\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 415, \"end\": 555, \"text\": \"There were four village development committees before- Ayodhyapuri (अयोध्यापुरी), Kalyanpur (कल्याणपुर), Gardi (गर्दी) and Baghauda (बघौडा).\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 556, \"end\": 605, \"text\": \"Madi is a beautiful valley surrounded by jungles.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 606, \"end\": 673, \"text\": \"In north by Chitwan National Park and in south bordered with India.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"start\": 674, \"end\": 679, \"text\": \"It is\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 83, \"text\": \"Madi, Chitwan Madi (माडी नगरपालिका) is a municipality in Chitwan District of Nepal.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 84, \"end\": 163, \"text\": \"With the population about 10,000, it is the fifth municipality in the district.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 164, \"end\": 310, \"text\": \"Basantapur was the major town of the former Baghauda Village Development Committee (बघौंडा गा.वि.स.) that was incorporated into Madi Municipality.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 311, \"end\": 351, \"text\": \"It is adjacent to Chitwan National Park.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 352, \"end\": 414, \"text\": \"This municipality was formed by cabinet dated 2071-01-28 (BS).\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 415, \"end\": 555, \"text\": \"There were four village development committees before- Ayodhyapuri (अयोध्यापुरी), Kalyanpur (कल्याणपुर), Gardi (गर्दी) and Baghauda (बघौडा).\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 556, \"end\": 605, \"text\": \"Madi is a beautiful valley surrounded by jungles.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 606, \"end\": 681, \"text\": \"In the north by Chitwan National Park and in the south bordered with India.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"start\": 682, \"end\": 730, \"text\": \"It is a serene area with a close-knit community.\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 518, \"text\": \"College , Ratnanagar Daisy English Higher Secondary Boarding School , Khairahani - 4 , Parsa Divya Jyoti Basic School , Harnari , Khairahani 13 Gawai Secondary School , Khairahani 13 , Gawai Grandee English Boarding School , Bharatpur-19 Holy Vision Public School , Yagyapuri , Bharatpur-4 Indreni ICT college , affiliated to Tribhuvan University , located at Muktinagar , Bharatpur International college is a college of higher education and runs the HSEB and TU affiliated BBS and MBS programs in management streams .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d02\", \"start\": 519, \"end\": 608, \"text\": \"Jan Aadrash multiple campus Birendranagar is the public campus in Birendranagar ward no .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d02\", \"start\": 609, \"end\": 612, \"text\": \"2 .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d02\", \"start\": 613, \"end\": 617, \"text\": \"Jana\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 145, \"text\": \"Nepal Government records as of 2017 , there were total 8,899 in Madi Municipality with 4,356 ( 48.95 % ) of males and 4,543 ( 51.05 % ) females .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d03\", \"start\": 146, \"end\": 175, \"text\": \"There were total 55 schools .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d03\", \"start\": 176, \"end\": 232, \"text\": \"In average , 162 students were studying in each school .\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d03\", \"start\": 233, \"end\": 326, \"text\": \"View Full Chart The pie-chart and graphs above further illustrates the students and schools .\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d03\", \"start\": 327, \"end\": 434, \"text\": \"Population by Language Spoken Mostly spoken language in Madi is Nepali , which is spoken by 22,795 people .\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d03\", \"start\": 435, \"end\": 528, \"text\": \"The Madi has people who speak other languages , such as Tharu , Tamang , Chepang , Bhojpuri ,\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Madi Municipality\", \"scope\": \"population\", \"claim\": \"The population of Madi Municipality is about 50,000.\", \"answer\": \"50,000\", \"quote\": \"With the population about 50,000, it is the fifth municipality in the district.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Madi Municipality\", \"scope\": \"population\", \"claim\": \"The population of Madi Municipality is about 10,000.\", \"answer\": \"10,000\", \"quote\": \"With the population about 10,000, it is the fifth municipality in the district.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d03\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0032-7d87e1704ac6:d03:c0\", \"entity\": \"Madi Municipality\", \"scope\": \"population\", \"claim\": \"The population of Madi Municipality is 8,899.\", \"answer\": \"8,899\", \"quote\": \"Nepal Government records as of 2017 , there were total 8,899 in Madi Municipality with 4,356 ( 48.95 % ) of males and 4,543 ( 51.05 % ) females .\", \"original_document_number\": 4}], \"R5_answers\": [\"50,000\", \"10,000\", \"8,899\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"50,000\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"10,000\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"8,899\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
